exports[`generate > creates tokens.json and all rules files from CSS > .cursor/rules/design.mdc 1`] = `
"---
description: Design system tokens. Use them for all UI styling.
globs: "**/*.{css,scss,html,jsx,tsx,vue,svelte}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Design system

Generated by Brandrails from \`tokens.json\`. Do not edit by hand; change \`tokens.json\` and regenerate.

- Use these tokens for every colour, spacing, radius, font, shadow and motion value.
- Never write raw hex, rgb or hsl colours, or px values for spacing and radius.
- Prefer role tokens (values like \`{color.black.900}\`) over raw scale steps.
- If no token fits, ask before adding a new value.

## Colour

- \`color.*\`: ink=#1c1917, ink-muted=#57534e, surface=#ffffff, surface-raised=#f5f5f4, border=#e7e5e4, accent=#4f46e5, accent-hover=#4338ca, danger=#dc2626

## Typography

- \`font.*\`: sans="Inter", system-ui, sans-serif, mono="JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace

## Spacing

- \`spacing.*\`: 1=0.25rem, 2=0.5rem, 4=1rem, 8=2rem

## Radius

- \`radius.*\`: sm=4px, md=8px, full=9999px

## Shadow

- \`shadow.card\`: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.06), 0 1px 3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)

## Motion: duration

- \`duration.fast\`: 120ms

## Motion: easing

- \`easing.standard\`: cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)
"
`;

